# Sundown Pass: only lands its controller controls count (CR 109.4). Bot2 has two lands and Bot1 one other land when it enters, so it enters tapped; the untapped scenarios are the control that two of Bot1's own lands matter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Sundown Pass
Mountain x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Sundown Pass.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sundown Pass.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 2
